<main>
  <h2>Location</h2>
  <p>
    UX Day Graz 2027 takes place at <strong>Graz University of Technology, Austria</strong>.
    All talks are held in one large lecture hall, and the workshop uses the seminar rooms next to it.
    Signs at the main entrance will show you the way.
  </p>

  <h2>Getting there</h2>
  <p>
    Graz is easy to reach by train, bus and plane. From Graz main station (Hauptbahnhof) you can
    take a tram to the university in about 20 minutes. Parking is very limited, so we recommend
    public transport or a bike.
  </p>

  <div class="info-grid">
    <div class="info-box">
      <h3>Check-in</h3>
      <p>Check-in opens at 08:00. Please bring your registration confirmation on your phone or on paper.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="info-box">
      <h3>Accessibility</h3>
      <p>The venue is step-free and has accessible toilets. Let us know in advance if you need any other support.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="info-box">
      <h3>Facilities</h3>
      <p>Free Wi-Fi, coffee and water all day, a cloakroom and quiet space for short breaks.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
